 class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-try=\"dark mode\">dark mode</button><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-try=\"go back\">go back</button></div></div><button class=\"st-bot\" id=\"stBot\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"idle\" aria-label=\"Logi, the assistant robot\"><span class=\"st-bub\" id=\"stBub\" hidden></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 72 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"rbHead\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFFFF\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#DCE4F7\"/></linearGradient></defs><ellipse class=\"rb-shadow\" cx=\"36\" cy=\"77\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"3\"/><g class=\"rb-all\"><line x1=\"36\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"13\" class=\"rb-stem\"/><circle cx=\"36\" cy=\"5\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"rb-ant\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"32\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"rb-ear\"/><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"32\" r=\"5.5\" class=\"rb-ear\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"12\" width=\"56\" height=\"42\" rx=\"21\" class=\"rb-head\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"19\" width=\"44\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\" class=\"rb-face\"/><g class=\"rb-eyes\"><ellipse cx=\"27\" cy=\"31.5\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"6\"/><ellipse cx=\"45\" cy=\"31.5\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"6\"/></g><g class=\"rb-shine\"><circle cx=\"29\" cy=\"29\" r=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"47\" cy=\"29\" r=\"1.8\"/></g><g class=\"rb-happy\"><path d=\"M22 33 q5 -6 10 0\"/><path d=\"M40 33 q5 -6 10 0\"/></g><ellipse cx=\"19.5\" cy=\"39\" rx=\"3.2\" ry=\"2\" class=\"rb-blush\"/><ellipse cx=\"52.5\" cy=\"39\" rx=\"3.2\" ry=\"2\" class=\"rb-blush\"/><path d=\"M32.5 39.5 q3.5 3 7 0\" class=\"rb-mouth\"/><path d=\"M22 61 q-8 2 -9 9\" class=\"rb-larm\"/><rect x=\"21\" y=\"54\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"rb-body\"/><path d=\"M36 67.5 c-3.5-2.4-5-4-5-6 a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5-1 a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 1 c0 2-1.5 3.6-5 6z\" class=\"rb-heart\"/><g class=\"rb-rarm\"><path d=\"M50 61 q7 -3 8 -11\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"47\" r=\"3.8\"/></g></g></svg></button></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: visual design range, platform conventions, responsive layouts, voice-driven interaction.</span><a href=\"/cross-platform-app-development/\">Explore app development →</a></p>\n<div class=\"sechead\" style=\"margin-top:96px\" id=\"design-system\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Design systems</p><h3 class=\"st-h\" style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,3.2vw,44px)\">One brand change. <em>Every</em> screen follows.</h3></div><p class=\"lede\">Every interface we design runs on tokens: colour, type, radius and spacing defined once and used everywhere. Change them and a website and an app restyle together, with accessibility checked as you go.</p></div><div class=\"tok\" id=\"tok\"><div class=\"bay ctrl\"><div><div class=\"lbl\">Brand colour</div><div class=\"swat\"><button type=\"button\" data-brand=\"#2F5BEA\" aria-label=\"Blue\" aria-pressed=\"true\" style=\"background:#2F5BEA\"></button><button type=\"button\" data-brand=\"#0E9F8E\" aria-label=\"Teal\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"background:#0E9F8E\"></button><button type=\"button\" data-brand=\"#E4572E\" aria-label=\"Coral\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"background:#E4572E\"></button><button type=\"button\" data-brand=\"#7B5CFF\" aria-label=\"Violet\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"background:#7B5CFF\"></button><button type=\"button\" data-brand=\"#B8893A\" aria-label=\"Gold\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"background:#B8893A\"></button><button type=\"button\" data-brand=\"#111111\" aria-label=\"Ink\" aria-pressed=\"false\" style=\"background:#111111\"></button><label class=\"swc\" title=\"Custom colour\"><input type=\"color\" id=\"tokColor\" value=\"#2F5BEA\" aria-label=\"Custom brand colour\"></label></div></div><div><div class=\"lbl\">Typeface pairing</div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-pair=\"editorial\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Editorial</button><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-pair=\"geometric\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Geometric</button><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-pair=\"friendly\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Friendly</button><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-pair=\"technical\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Technical</button></div></div><div><label class=\"lbl\" for=\"tokR\">Corner radius <output id=\"tokROut\">12px</output></label><input type=\"range\" id=\"tokR\" min=\"0\" max=\"28\" value=\"12\"></div><div><div class=\"lbl\">Density</div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-dens=\"0.8\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Compact</button><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-dens=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Comfortable</button><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-dens=\"1.25\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Spacious</button></div></div><div><div class=\"lbl\">Mode</div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-tmode=\"light\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Light</button><button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-tmode=\"dark\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Dark</button></div></div></div><div class=\"bay tok-prev\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>live preview · website + mobile</span><span>one set of tokens</span></div><div class=\"tp\" id=\"tp\"><div class=\"tp-site\"><div class=\"tp-nav\"><b>Lumen</b><span>Product</span><span>Pricing</span><span>Stories</span><span class=\"tp-btn sm\">Sign in</span></div><div class=\"tp-hero\"><span class=\"tp-badge\">New · 2026 release</span><p class=\"tp-h\">Design that earns trust.</p><p class=\"tp-p\">A sample landing page restyled live by the controls. Every colour, font, corner and gap comes from one set of design tokens.</p><div class=\"tp-ctas\"><span class=\"tp-btn\">Get started</span><span class=\"tp-btn ghost\">See pricing</span></div></div><div class=\"tp-feats\"><div><span class=\"tp-ic\"></span><b>Fast onboarding</b><span>Live in a day, not a quarter.</span></div><div><span class=\"tp-ic\"></span><b>Secure by default</b><span>Roles, audit trails, encryption.</span></div><div><span class=\"tp-ic\"></span><b>Works offline</b><span>Syncs the moment you reconnect.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"tp-phone\"><div class=\"tp-card\"><small>Thu, 14 Nov</small><b>Book a session</b><div class=\"tp-slots\"><span>10:00</span><span class=\"on\">11:30</span><span>16:00</span></div><span class=\"tp-btn full\">Confirm</span></div><div class=\"tp-card\"><b>Weekly goal</b><div class=\"tp-bar\"><i></i></div><small>68% complete</small></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bay tok-out\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>generated design tokens</span><span id=\"tokAA\"></span></div><div class=\"tok-grid\"><div><div class=\"lbl\">Brand scale</div><div class=\"tok-scale\" id=\"tokScale\"></div><div class=\"lbl\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Accessibility checks</div><div class=\"tok-checks\" id=\"tokChecks\"></div></div><pre class=\"tok-code\" id=\"tokCode\"></pre></div></div></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: design systems, colour scales, type pairing, WCAG contrast checks.</span><a href=\"/ui-ux-design/\">Explore UI/UX design →</a></p></div></section>\n<section class=\"g\" id=\"planner\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sechead\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Solution architecture</p><h2>Change the requirements. Watch the system <em>redesign</em> itself.</h2></div><p class=\"lede\">This is how our engagements start. Set your scale and features; the architecture, data flows and decision log update the way our architects reason through them.</p></div><div class=\"arch\"><div class=\"bay ctrl\"><div><label class=\"lbl\" for=\"users\">Expected users <output id=\"usersOut\">10k</output></label><input type=\"range\" id=\"users\" min=\"0\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\"></div><div><div class=\"lbl\">Capabilities</div><div class=\"chips\" id=\"feat\"><button class=\"chip\" data-f=\"payments\" aria-pressed=\"true\">payments</button><button class=\"chip\" data-f=\"offline\" aria-pressed=\"false\">offline-first</button><button class=\"chip\" data-f=\"realtime\" aria-pressed=\"false\">chat / calls</button><button class=\"chip\" data-f=\"ai\" aria-pressed=\"false\">AI features</button><button class=\"chip\" data-f=\"tenant\" aria-pressed=\"false\">multi-tenant SaaS</button><button class=\"chip\" data-f=\"pos\" aria-pressed=\"false\">POS & retail</button><button class=\"chip\" data-f=\"desktop\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Windows / macOS apps</button><button class=\"chip\" data-f=\"web3\" aria-pressed=\"false\">blockchain / web3</button></div></div><div><div class=\"lbl\">Infrastructure tier</div><div class=\"tier\" id=\"tier\"></div><div id=\"tierName\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\"></div></div></div><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>system diagram · auto-generated</span><span id=\"archCount\"></span></div><div class=\"dscroll\"><svg id=\"archSvg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 430\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"System architecture diagram for the selected requirements\"></svg></div><div class=\"log\" id=\"archLog\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: capacity planning, service boundaries, caching, queues, offline sync and tenancy trade-offs.</span><a href=\"/solution-architecture/\">Explore solution architecture →</a></p></div></section><section class=\"g\" id=\"blueprint\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sechead\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">AI engineering</p><h2>Describe your project. Get a <em>blueprint</em> in seconds.</h2></div><p class=\"lede\">A working AI feature, not a mockup. Your brief goes to a language model with an architect’s instructions and comes back as structured data: modules, stack, phases and risks.</p></div><div class=\"ai\"><div class=\"bay ai-in\"><label for=\"brief\" class=\"lbl\">Project brief</label><textarea id=\"brief\">A home physiotherapy booking platform in Qatar. Patients book visits, therapists get routed to homes, admin manages schedules and payments. Arabic and English.</textarea><div class=\"chips\" id=\"presets\" aria-label=\"Example briefs\"><button class=\"chip\" data-brief=\"Restaurant chain ERP: POS billing at each outlet, kitchen display, inventory across 6 outlets, works offline when internet drops.\">restaurant ERP</button><button class=\"chip\" data-brief=\"Construction company ERP: project costing, site material requests, labour attendance from a mobile app, approvals for managers.\">construction ERP</button><button class=\"chip\" data-brief=\"Crypto payment gateway for e-commerce stores: accept USDT and ETH, auto-convert to INR, merchant dashboard, wallet monitoring and on-chain receipts.\">crypto gateway</button><button class=\"chip\" data-brief=\"Study-abroad CRM with an AI calling agent that speaks Malayalam and English to qualify leads and book counsellor appointments.\">AI calling CRM</button></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"gen\">Generate blueprint</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"stopGen\" hidden>Stop</button><span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--dim)\" id=\"aiMode\">connecting to model…</span></div><div class=\"trace\" id=\"trace\" aria-hidden=\"true\">model output streams here as it is written…</div></div><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>blueprint · structured output</span><span id=\"bpStatus\">example</span></div><div class=\"bp\" id=\"bp\" data-endpoint=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: prompt design, streaming, JSON-structured output with validation, graceful fallback.</span><a href=\"/ai-solutions/\">Explore ai engineering →</a></p></div></section><section class=\"g\" id=\"platform-demo\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sechead\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Every platform</p><h2>One product. <em>Five</em> platforms. Try it.</h2></div><p class=\"lede\">A working booking flow with real state. Switch between Android, iOS, Windows, macOS and Web: the product adapts to each platform and your booking survives the switch.</p></div><div class=\"plat-demo\"><div><div class=\"dev ios\" id=\"dev\"><div class=\"bar\"><span>9:41</span><span>●●● ▮</span></div><div class=\"appbar\" id=\"appbar\"><strong class=\"ttl\">Book a visit</strong></div><div class=\"screen\" id=\"screen\"></div></div><div class=\"chips\" id=\"plat\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Platform\" style=\"justify-content:center;margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"chip\" data-p=\"android\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Android</button><button class=\"chip\" data-p=\"ios\" aria-pressed=\"true\">iOS</button><button class=\"chip\" data-p=\"windows\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Windows</button><button class=\"chip\" data-p=\"macos\" aria-pressed=\"false\">macOS</button><button class=\"chip\" data-p=\"web\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Web</button></div></div><div class=\"bay\" style=\"width:100%\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>component tree</span><span id=\"stateName\"></span></div><div class=\"tree\" id=\"tree\"></div></div></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: shared business logic, platform conventions, state management, offline-ready clients.</span><a href=\"/cross-platform-app-development/\">Explore every platform →</a></p></div></section><section class=\"g\" id=\"chain-demo\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sechead\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Blockchain & crypto</p><h2>Edit one block. Watch the whole chain <em>break</em>.</h2></div><p class=\"lede\">A real proof-of-work chain running in your browser with SHA-256. Change any transaction and every block after it turns invalid. Press Mine to repair it.</p></div><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>ledger · difficulty 3 · sha-256</span><span id=\"chainStat\" class=\"mono\">chain valid</span></div><div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div><div class=\"web3\"><div><b>Smart contracts</b><span>Token, staking, escrow and governance contracts, tested and reviewed.</span></div><div><b>Wallets &amp; dApps</b><span>Wallet integration and decentralised app front ends.</span></div><div><b>Tokens &amp; NFTs</b><span>Token launches, NFT marketplaces, minting and royalty logic.</span></div><div><b>Exchange integrations</b><span>Crypto payment gateways, exchange APIs, on-chain analytics.</span></div></div></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: cryptographic hashing, proof-of-work, chain integrity, tamper detection.</span><a href=\"/blockchain-development/\">Explore blockchain & crypto →</a></p></div></section><section class=\"g\" id=\"bot-demo\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sechead\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Bots & automation</p><h2>A trading bot, live. Change its <em>strategy</em> mid-run.</h2></div><p class=\"lede\">An automated agent reading a market feed, deciding and acting with no human in the loop. Market data here is simulated; this is not financial advice.</p></div><div class=\"bot\"><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>DEMO/USDT · 1m candles · simulated</span><span id=\"botState\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> running</span></div><canvas id=\"candles\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Candlestick chart with the bot's buy and sell markers\"></canvas><div class=\"botctl\"><label for=\"strat\" class=\"lbl\" style=\"margin:0\">Strategy</label><select id=\"strat\"><option value=\"ma\">Moving-average crossover (9/21)</option><option value=\"mr\">Mean reversion (±1.5σ)</option><option value=\"mo\">Momentum breakout (20)</option></select><button class=\"btn\" id=\"botToggle\" style=\"min-height:40px\">Pause</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"botReset\" style=\"min-height:40px\">Reset</button></div></div><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"pnl\"><div><span>Equity</span><b id=\"eq\">10,000</b></div><div><span>P&amp;L</span><b id=\"pl\">0.00%</b></div><div><span>Trades</span><b id=\"nt\">0</b></div><div><span>Position</span><b id=\"pos\">flat</b></div></div><div class=\"tlog\" id=\"tlog\"></div></div></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: event-driven agents, strategy engines, execution logic, risk and P&amp;L tracking.</span><a href=\"/bots-automation/\">Explore bots & automation →</a></p></div></section><section class=\"g\" id=\"scale-demo\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sechead\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Realtime & scale</p><h2>Hit it with a traffic spike. It <em>scales</em>.</h2></div><p class=\"lede\">A live operations console streaming simulated events. Press the spike button: load jumps, latency climbs, the autoscaler adds instances and brings latency back under target.</p></div><div class=\"rt\"><div class=\"bay kpi\"><span>requests / s</span><b id=\"kRps\">0</b><small id=\"kRpsD\" style=\"color:var(--muted)\">steady</small></div><div class=\"bay kpi\"><span>p95 latency</span><b id=\"kLat\">0</b><small id=\"kLatD\" style=\"color:var(--ok)\">under 120 ms target</small></div><div class=\"bay kpi\"><span>instances</span><b id=\"kPods\">2</b><small style=\"color:var(--muted)\">autoscaling 2–12</small></div><div class=\"bay kpi\"><span>error rate</span><b id=\"kErr\">0.0%</b><small style=\"color:var(--muted)\">last 30 s</small></div><div class=\"rt-main\"><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>throughput &amp; latency · last 60 s</span><span><span style=\"color:var(--trace)\">━ req/s</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"color:var(--amber)\">━ p95 ms</span></span></div><canvas id=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Live chart of requests per second and p95 latency\"></canvas><div class=\"pods\" id=\"pods\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>event stream</span><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"spike\" style=\"min-height:32px;padding:0 12px;font-size:12px\">Simulate spike</button></div><div class=\"feed\" id=\"feed\"></div></div></div></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: event streaming, horizontal autoscaling, latency budgets, observability.</span><a href=\"/cloud-backend-engineering/\">Explore realtime & scale →</a></p></div></section><section class=\"g\" id=\"pay-demo\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"sechead\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Payments & fintech</p><h2>Drop the network mid-payment. Nobody gets charged <em>twice</em>.</h2></div><p class=\"lede\">A UPI payment lifecycle with idempotency keys and webhook confirmation. Turn on the network failure and run it: the client retries safely and the ledger still shows one charge.</p></div><div class=\"pay\"><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>payment state machine</span><span id=\"payId\">idempotency-key: —</span></div><div class=\"states\" id=\"states\"></div><div class=\"pay-ctl\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"payBtn\">Pay ₹1,250 via UPI</button><label class=\"toggle\" for=\"drop\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"drop\" checked> Simulate network drop</label></div></div><div class=\"bay\"><div class=\"bay-head\"><span>server log</span><span>webhooks · retries</span></div><div class=\"plog\" id=\"plog\"></div><div class=\"ledger\"><span>Ledger: charges for this order</span><b id=\"ledger\">0</b></div></div></div><p class=\"proof\"><span>Competency on display: payment gateway integration, idempotency, webhook verification, reconciliation.</span><a href=\"/saas-product-development/\">Explore payments & fintech →</a></p></div></section>",
